   "source": "paper_a_film_boiling.tex",
   "section": "results",
   "text": "Figure 2 shows the film thickness against time for three contact angles. The film on the hydrophilic wall thins slowly and ruptures last. On the hydrophobic wall, a dry patch appears early. We find that rupture time falls as the contact angle grows.",
