   "source": "paper_a_film_boiling.tex",
   "section": "results",
   "text": "We next look at the temperature field near the contact line. Figure 3 shows a hot spot under the thinnest part of the film. The hot spot is stronger on the hydrophobic wall. This agrees with the faster rupture seen in Figure 2.",
